														This is considered an outdoor zone, so SoW, wolfform, etc will all work.  Depending on the number of people listed to attend, we will divide the groups up into even groups around the same level.<br />
<br />
Since this is a mid-level raid, we will divide the groups up so that each group has a well-balanced team.  If we do not have enough to balance the teams out, we may just go for loot instead of exp.<br />
<br />
Like I said, it all depends on who goes.  I would like a list, if possible, attached to the event on our event board to let us know who is coming.  Date and time are still tentative, and please post here if the date and time does not work for you..  Currently, we're setting it up for Saturday, April 13, just so we can go scope out the zone (since I've been there about twice) before we go.						</td>
